{"steam_appid":3784030,"steam_name":"RACCOIN: Coin Pusher Roguelike","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3784030/1871878160/7b7416171d5dd5d3aa4ab66515199b5cffabd86d/1774861768/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1774945961","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257311310/ed1a03867889775f8c34538afb351793e1e41f8a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1774945961","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784030/9dc3df02e3195847fd0dd61a5931712faadc40ec/ss_9dc3df02e3195847fd0dd61a5931712faadc40ec.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786037377","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784030/86ab76b194788a3ac7188cc79f69d9293ebb76d5/ss_86ab76b194788a3ac7188cc79f69d9293ebb76d5.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786037377","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784030/347ad829f66d8d0c8cc32cfdfbc6b5b2099128e4/ss_347ad829f66d8d0c8cc32cfdfbc6b5b2099128e4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786037377","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784030/b35de7a491b09573ad84b72b6d9afd50297a9320/ss_b35de7a491b09573ad84b72b6d9afd50297a9320.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786037377","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784030/35bb5c1df6d0aae62a1d52cba320a4a77b76d78e/ss_35bb5c1df6d0aae62a1d52cba320a4a77b76d78e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786037377"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RACCOIN: Coin Pusher Roguelike</strong> blends the chaotic fun of classic arcade coin pushers with the element of roguelike deckbuilding. Combine special coins with powerful items to trigger satisfying synergies. It’s a nonstop dopamine rush packed into one unpredictable, coin dropping ride.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784030/extras/7d9d5f300d059342e6ab6cb271b1f26c.poster.avif?t=1786037377\" width=780 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784030/extras/7d9d5f300d059342e6ab6cb271b1f26c.webm?t=1786037377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784030/extras/7d9d5f300d059342e6ab6cb271b1f26c.mp4?t=1786037377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784030/extras/1f550468a3ff6845c3b91a37ce69220c.avif?t=1786037377\" width=1228 height=242 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover all kinds of special coins during your runs! Combine Seed Coins with Water Coins to grow a money tree right inside your machine. Drop a Cat Coin to hunt down every last Rat Coin and rack up extra tickets. Need more points? Use a MultiCoin to boost your score across the board. Too slow? Blast a TNT Coin to trigger a massive explosion and blast every coin forward at once!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784030/extras/01bebf0bef78f426032a1c844b8e4828.poster.avif?t=1786037377\" width=780 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784030/extras/01bebf0bef78f426032a1c844b8e4828.webm?t=1786037377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784030/extras/01bebf0bef78f426032a1c844b8e4828.mp4?t=1786037377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784030/extras/b54fdfc04f9a0560363a0bfa8872423f.avif?t=1786037377\" width=1228 height=257 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover 150 unique items that can dramatically shift the course of your run. Stack multipliers, spawn coins with extra points, or simply shake the machine when you're running dry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Apply special plating to your favorite coins to enhance their effects and unlock even wilder combos. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784030/extras/077081d5d0c676423ff7dbf00ac930e6.poster.avif?t=1786037377\" width=780 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784030/extras/077081d5d0c676423ff7dbf00ac930e6.webm?t=1786037377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784030/extras/077081d5d0c676423ff7dbf00ac930e6.mp4?t=1786037377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784030/extras/218cca93c7337e2264e04f50f4c06769.avif?t=1786037377\" width=1228 height=280 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as one of several unique characters, each with their own set of themed coins and playstyle. Take on the role of a greedy raccoon manager who excels at math-based combos, or a quirky biologist who specializes in animal-based coins. Every character offers a fresh and wildly different way to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784030/extras/64c96b7635c74842e1ca1da9410fbf4c.poster.avif?t=1786037377\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784030/extras/64c96b7635c74842e1ca1da9410fbf4c.webm?t=1786037377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784030/extras/40bd9fec16e9ccadddab085560c162ef.avif?t=1786037377\" width=1560 height=290 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 playable characters, each with their own unique coins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >150 distinct coins with special effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >150 power-up items with unique abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless run mode for infinite replayability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 difficulty levels to master</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10, 11 <br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-7500, AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 1060 3gb, AMD Radeon R9 Fury<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows10, 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-7500, AMD Ryzen 5 3600 or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce RTX 2060，AMD Radeon 5600XT or better<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Casual","Indie","Simulation","Strategy"],"developers":["Doraccoon "],"publishers":["Playstack"],"release_date":"Mar 31, 2026"}